---
interface Props {
  locale?: "en" | "ko";
}

const { locale = "en" } = Astro.props;
const isKo = locale === "ko";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, "/");
const prefix = isKo ? `${base}ko/` : base;
const docUrl = (slug: string) => `${prefix}${slug.replace(/^\/+/, "")}`;
const demoReportUrl = `${base}demo/tokprof-sample.html`;
---

<div class="at-landing not-content">
  <!-- 1. PyHookKit-inspired Responsive Hero + 3-Step Stage -->
  <section class="at-hero" aria-labelledby="_top">
    <div class="at-hero-copy">
      <span class="at-eyebrow">
        <i class="at-eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {isKo
          ? "토큰 이코노믹스 (TOKENOMICS · TOKEN ECONOMICS) · LLM 및 AI 에이전트 토큰 절약 가이드"
          : "TOKENOMICS & TOKEN ECONOMICS · PRACTICAL LLM & AI AGENT PLAYBOOK"}
      </span>
      <h1 id="_top" data-page-title="" class="at-hero-title">
        {isKo ? (
          <>
            <span class="at-h1-kicker">LLM · 에이전트 토큰 이코노믹스 (Tokenomics · Token Economics)</span>
            AI 도구의 품질은 유지하면서,<br />
            <span class="at-accent-text">불필요한 토큰 사용을 줄이세요.</span>
          </>
        ) : (
          <>
            <span class="at-h1-kicker">LLM &amp; Agent Tokenomics (Token Economics)</span>
            Spend fewer tokens,<br />
            <span class="at-accent-text">without making your AI tools worse.</span>
          </>
        )}
      </h1>
      <p class="at-hero-subtitle">
        {isKo
          ? "LLM과 AI 에이전트를 위한 실전 토큰 이코노믹스(Tokenomics · Token Economics, 토큰 경제학) 가이드입니다. VS Code에서 GitHub Copilot을 사용하는 개발자(트랙 A)는 마켓플레이스 확장 cctx로 탐색 토큰을 줄이고 개발 속도를 가속하며, 에이전트를 개발·운영하는 엔지니어(트랙 B)는 코드 수정 없는 프로파일러 tokprof로 LLM 호출을 분석하고 비용과 품질을 검증할 수 있습니다."
          : "Practical tokenomics (token economics) for developers using GitHub Copilot in VS Code (Track A) and engineers who build or operate LLM agents (Track B). Cut lookup tokens and accelerate coding tasks with the cctx VS Code Marketplace extension, and profile agent LLM calls with tokprof without changing agent code."}
      </p>
      <div class="at-hero-actions">
        <a class="at-btn at-btn-primary" href={docUrl("copilot-tokenomics/")}>
          {isKo ? "트랙 A: Copilot 토큰 절약 →" : "Track A: Copilot Tokenomics →"}
        </a>
        <a class="at-btn at-btn-secondary" href={docUrl("agent-tokenomics/")}>
          {isKo ? "트랙 B: 에이전트 토큰 절약 →" : "Track B: Agent Tokenomics →"}
        </a>
        <a class="at-btn at-btn-secondary" href={docUrl("copilot-tokenomics/cctx/")}>
          {isKo ? "cctx: VS Code 확장 및 가속 →" : "cctx: VS Code Extension →"}
        </a>
        <a class="at-btn at-btn-secondary" href={docUrl("agent-tokenomics/tokprof/")}>
          {isKo ? "tokprof 설치 및 사용법 →" : "tokprof Install & Usage →"}
        </a>
        <a class="at-btn at-btn-ghost" href="#tokprof-showcase">
          {isKo ? "실행 화면과 HTML 예시 보기 ↓" : "See CLI & HTML Report ↓"}
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="at-stage" aria-label={isKo ? "토큰 사용량을 줄이는 3단계" : "Three steps to reduce token usage"}>
      <div class="at-stage-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="at-stage-kicker">
        <span>{isKo ? "측정하고 개선하기" : "MEASURE THEN IMPROVE"}</span>
        <span>{isKo ? "트랙 A와 트랙 B 공통" : "TRACK A & TRACK B"}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="at-stage-steps">
        <article class="at-stage-step s-measure">
          <span class="at-stage-num">01</span>
          <span class="at-stage-icon">M</span>
          <strong>{isKo ? "먼저 측정하기" : "Measure First"}</strong>
          <small>
            {isKo
              ? "tokprof start 또는 Copilot 디버그 로그로 토큰 사용량과 캐시 적중률을 확인하세요."
              : "Check token usage and cache hit rate with tokprof start or Copilot Debug Logs."}
          </small>
          <span class="at-stage-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
        </article>
        <span class="at-stage-conn" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <article class="at-stage-step s-isolate">
          <span class="at-stage-num">02</span>
          <span class="at-stage-icon">I</span>
          <strong>{isKo ? "낭비 원인 확인하기" : "Isolate the Cause"}</strong>
          <small>
            {isKo
              ? "사용하지 않는 도구, 반복 실패, 대화 기록 증가가 토큰 사용량에 미치는 영향을 확인하세요."
              : "See how unused tools, repeated errors, and history growth drive token cost."}
          </small>
          <span class="at-stage-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
        </article>
        <span class="at-stage-conn" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        <article class="at-stage-step s-improve">
          <span class="at-stage-num">03</span>
          <span class="at-stage-icon">G</span>
          <strong>{isKo ? "개선하고 품질 확인하기" : "Improve & Verify"}</strong>
          <small>
            {isKo
              ? "도구 가지치기, 루프 가드, 프롬프트 캐싱을 적용한 뒤 작업 성공률을 확인하세요."
              : "Apply tool pruning, loop guards, and prompt caching while checking pass rate."}
          </small>
          <span class="at-stage-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="at-stage-result">
        <span class="at-stage-badge">T</span>
        <div class="at-stage-result-body">
          <small>{isKo ? "TokenEconomizer에서 보고한 결과" : "Reported in TokenEconomizer"}</small>
          <strong>
            {isKo
              ? "SWE-Bench에서 에이전트와 모델 조합 5개의 평균 비용이 18.4~30.9% 감소했습니다."
              : "18.4–30.9% lower mean cost on SWE-Bench across 5 agent–model pairs (as reported)."}
          </strong>
        </div>
        <span class="at-stage-live"><i></i>{isKo ? "연구 결과" : "Reported"}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. Real tokprof CLI Execution & HTML Report Preview -->
  <section id="tokprof-showcase" class="at-tokprof-section" aria-labelledby="tokprof-showcase-title">
    <div class="at-sec-head">
      <span class="at-eyebrow">
        <i class="at-eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        {isKo ? "코드 수정 없이 사용하는 LLM 토큰 프로파일러 · tokprof" : "ZERO-CODE LLM TOKEN PROFILER · TOKPROF"}
      </span>
      <h2 id="tokprof-showcase-title">
        {isKo
          ? "tokprof start로 토큰 사용량을 측정하고 HTML 리포트로 살펴보세요"
          : "Run tokprof start to measure token usage and inspect the HTML report"}
      </h2>
      <p>
        {isKo ? (
          <>
            <code>tokprof</code>는 로컬 게이트웨이, 프로세스 내부 훅 또는 Linux eBPF를 사용해 지원되는 LLM 요청을 수집합니다. 수집 가능한 요청은 실행 환경과 선택한 방식에 따라 달라집니다(eBPF를 사용할 수 없는 환경에서는 <code>eval "$(tokprof env)"</code>로 새 프로세스의 요청을 게이트웨이로 전달합니다). 아래 화면은 합성 데이터(<a href="https://github.com/dotnetpower/agent-tokenomics/blob/main/examples/sample-requests.jsonl"><code>examples/sample-requests.jsonl</code></a>, 7개 호출)를 사용한 실행 예시입니다.
          </>
        ) : (
          <>
            <code>tokprof</code> captures supported LLM requests via a local gateway, in-process hooks, or Linux eBPF depending on your environment (when eBPF is unavailable, run <code>eval "$(tokprof env)"</code> so new processes route through the gateway). The terminal session and HTML report preview below are a synthetic example based on <a href="https://github.com/dotnetpower/agent-tokenomics/blob/main/examples/sample-requests.jsonl"><code>examples/sample-requests.jsonl</code></a> (7 calls).
          </>
        )}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="at-cmd-strip">
      <div class="at-cmd-card">
        <div class="at-cmd-card-top">
          <span>{isKo ? "01 / PyPI 설치" : "01 / INSTALL (PyPI)"}</span>
          <span>Linux · macOS · Win</span>
        </div>
        <code>pip install tokprof</code>
        <span>
          {isKo
            ? "Rust/Go 설치 없이 프리빌트 네이티브 바이너리를 바로 설치합니다 (uv tool install tokprof 또는 uvx tokprof도 지원)."
            : "Installs the prebuilt native binary from PyPI with no Rust or Go toolchain required (or use uv tool install tokprof / uvx tokprof)."}
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="at-cmd-card">
        <div class="at-cmd-card-top">
          <span>{isKo ? "02 / 측정 시작" : "02 / START SESSION"}</span>
          <span>Background / CLI</span>
        </div>
        <code>tokprof start</code>
        <span>
          {isKo
            ? "백그라운드 측정 세션을 시작합니다. 지원되는 Linux에서는 eBPF로 실행 중인 프로세스와 Docker를 수집하며, 단일 명령은 tokprof -- python app.py로 실행합니다."
            : "Starts a background session (auto-attaches eBPF on supported Linux hosts), or run a single command with tokprof -- python app.py."}
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="at-cmd-card">
        <div class="at-cmd-card-top">
          <span>{isKo ? "03 / 수집 상태 확인" : "03 / CHECK STATUS"}</span>
          <span>Live Count</span>
        </div>
        <code>tokprof status</code>
        <span>
          {isKo
            ? "에이전트에서 측정할 작업을 실행한 뒤, 활성 세션과 지금까지 수집된 LLM 호출 수를 확인합니다."
            : "Run the agent task you want to measure, then check the active session and recorded LLM call count."}
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="at-cmd-card">
        <div class="at-cmd-card-top">
          <span>{isKo ? "04 / 측정 종료 및 리포트" : "04 / STOP & REPORT"}</span>
          <span>CLI + HTML + CSV</span>
        </div>
        <code>tokprof stop</code>
        <span>
          {isKo
            ? "측정을 종료하고 터미널 요약표와 대화형 HTML 리포트(.tokprof/latest.html)를 확인합니다."
            : "Stops the session, prints the terminal breakdown, and writes the HTML report (.tokprof/latest.html)."}
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="at-install-bar">
      <div class="at-install-bar-cmds">
        <span><strong>{isKo ? "빠른 실행 명령어:" : "Quick commands:"}</strong></span>
        <code>uvx tokprof --lang ko</code>
        <code>tokprof -- python my_agent.py</code>
        <code>tokprof report --html --open</code>
        <code>tokprof compare before.jsonl after.jsonl</code>
      </div>
      <div class="at-install-bar-links">
        <a class="at-btn at-btn-primary" href={docUrl("agent-tokenomics/tokprof/")} style="padding:0.48rem 0.9rem;font-size:0.82rem">
          {isKo ? "tokprof 설치 및 사용법 전체 보기 →" : "Full tokprof Install & Usage Guide →"}
        </a>
        <a class="at-btn at-btn-secondary" href="https://pypi.org/project/tokprof/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="padding:0.48rem 0.9rem;font-size:0.82rem">
          PyPI: tokprof ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="at-showcase-split">
      <!-- 2A. Terminal Execution Window -->
      <div class="tp-term" role="region" aria-label={isKo ? "tokprof 명령 실행 예시" : "tokprof command execution example"}>
        <div class="tp-term-bar">
          <div class="tp-term-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <span class="tp-term-title">
            bash — tokprof start → tokprof status → tokprof stop (synthetic example)
          </span>
          <span class="tp-term-pill">
            {isKo ? "합성 데이터를 사용한 실행 예시" : "Synthetic 7-call session example"}
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="tp-term-body">
          <pre class="tp-term-pre"><code><span class="tp-c-prompt">$</span> <span class="tp-c-cmd">tokprof start</span>
<span class="tp-c-dim">tokprof: session started (pid 48210, gateway 127.0.0.1:41932, eBPF: all processes &amp; Docker containers, max 3m/180s)</span>
<span class="tp-c-dim">  recording to: /workspace/.tokprof/20261106-synthetic.jsonl</span>
<span class="tp-c-dim">  Running host processes, background services, and Docker containers are captured automatically.</span>
<span class="tp-c-dim">  Check progress: tokprof status   |   Live view: tokprof report --watch   |   Finish &amp; report: tokprof stop</span>

<span class="tp-c-dim"># {isKo ? "에이전트에서 측정할 작업을 실행합니다." : "Run the agent task you want to profile."}</span>
<span class="tp-c-prompt">$</span> <span class="tp-c-cmd">tokprof status</span>
<span class="tp-c-dim">tokprof: active session pid 48210, gateway 127.0.0.1:41932, eBPF: all processes &amp; Docker containers</span>
<span class="tp-c-dim">  requests seen: 7, LLM calls recorded: 7, errors: 0</span>

<span class="tp-c-prompt">$</span> <span class="tp-c-cmd">tokprof stop</span>
<span class="tp-c-dim">tokprof: session stopped (recorded 7 call(s) in /workspace/.tokprof/20261106-synthetic.jsonl)</span>
<span class="tp-c-bold">╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮</span>
<span class="tp-c-bold">│  tokprof — LLM Token Profile (Per-Session · Per-Turn · Prompt Inspector)                 │</span>
<span class="tp-c-bold">╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯</span>
  Sessions: <span class="tp-c-bold">1</span>   Turns: <span class="tp-c-bold">3</span>   Calls: <span class="tp-c-bold">7</span>   Input: <span class="tp-c-bold">73,000</span>   Output: <span class="tp-c-bold">1,580</span>   Cached: <span class="tp-c-bold">47,700</span> (65.3%)
  First-call overhead: 9,200 tok   Median input/call: 9,600 tok   Fan-out: median 2, max 4 calls/turn

  <span class="tp-c-bold">1. Input token breakdown (total)</span>
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  System prompt                         44,800   61.4%  <span class="tp-c-sys">████████████████░░░░░░░░░░</span>
  Tools: definitions                    16,800   23.0%  <span class="tp-c-tdef">██████░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░</span>
  Tools: results                         4,620    6.3%  <span class="tp-c-tres">█▋░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░</span>
  History: user turns                    2,670    3.7%  <span class="tp-c-hist">█░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░</span>
  Current user prompt                    1,870    2.6%  <span class="tp-c-user">▋░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░</span>
  History: assistant turns               1,400    1.9%  <span class="tp-c-hist">▌░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░</span>
  Unattributed (template/hidden)           840    1.2%  <span class="tp-c-dim">▎░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░</span>

  <span class="tp-c-bold">3. Per-Turn breakdown &amp; prompt summary (System / History / User Prompt / Tools &amp; Schema)</span>
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  turn       calls     system    history  user_prompt  tools/schema    total_in    cached  output
  S1·T1          4     25,600      2,230          930         9,960      39,200    28,400     680
     <span class="tp-c-user">User prompt:</span> Fix the failing discount boundary test in checkout.py
     <span class="tp-c-dim">Assistant:</span> &#123;"tool":"read_file","path":"src/checkout.py"&#125;
  S1·T2          1      6,400      1,440          540         6,600      15,100    10,300     420
     <span class="tp-c-user">User prompt:</span> Patch &gt;= 100 boundary and verify with .venv/bin/pytest -q
     <span class="tp-c-dim">Assistant:</span> Patched boundary check (`&gt;= 100`) and verified with `.venv/bin/pytest -q` (14 passed).
  S1·T3          2     12,800        400          400         4,860      18,700     9,000     480
     <span class="tp-c-user">User prompt:</span> Run test suite for currency rounding module
     <span class="tp-c-dim">Assistant:</span> All 8 rounding tests passed in 0.09s.

  <span class="tp-c-bold">Findings &amp; recommendations</span>
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  <span class="tp-c-high">[HIGH]</span> 2 tool definition(s) were sent but never called (14,000 tokens, 19.2% of input): browser_open, notebook_edit
  <span class="tp-c-high">[HIGH]</span> Tool call 'run_tests' was repeated 3 times in a row (28,800 input tokens): add a loop guard
  <span class="tp-c-med">[MEDIUM]</span> Unfiltered read_file tool output (4,200 tokens) pushed Turn 2 input to 15,100 tokens

<span class="tp-c-ok">tokprof: HTML dashboard written to .tokprof/latest.html</span>
<span class="tp-c-ok">tokprof: Report server live at http://127.0.0.1:18765/latest.html</span></code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2B. Embedded Result HTML Report Excerpt (.tokprof/latest.html) -->
      <div
        class="tp-browser-frame"
        id="tokprof-html-preview"
        role="region"
        aria-label={isKo ? "tokprof HTML 리포트 미리보기" : "tokprof HTML report preview"}
      >
        <div class="tp-browser-chrome">
          <div class="tp-term-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <div class="tp-browser-url">
            <span aria-hidden="true">🔒</span>
            <span>http://127.0.0.1:18765/latest.html</span>
            <span style="opacity:0.65">(.tokprof/latest.html — Edition Dossier)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tp-browser-actions">
            <button
              type="button"
              class="tp-ed-theme-btn"
              onclick="document.getElementById('tokprof-html-preview').classList.toggle('is-dark')"
            >
              {isKo ? "Paper / Night 테마 전환" : "Toggle Paper / Night"}
            </button>
            <a class="tp-report-link" href={demoReportUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              {isKo ? "전체 HTML 예시 열기 ↗" : "Open full HTML sample ↗"}
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tp-edition-preview">
          <header class="tp-ed-masthead">
            <div class="tp-ed-brand">
              <span class="tp-ed-mark">T</span>
              <div>
                tokprof
                <small>
                  {isKo
                    ? "Edition 리포트 · LLM 토큰 구성과 프롬프트 확인 예시"
                    : "Edition Report · LLM Token Composition & Prompt Inspector Example"}
                </small>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="tp-ed-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label={isKo ? "리포트 보기 선택" : "Report view selection"}>
              <button
                type="button"
                role="tab"
                class="tp-ed-tab"
                data-tp-tab="all"
                aria-selected="true"
                onclick="window.__setTpTab && window.__setTpTab('all')"
              >
                {isKo ? "전체 보기" : "All Views"}
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                role="tab"
                class="tp-ed-tab"
                data-tp-tab="composition"
                aria-selected="false"
                onclick="window.__setTpTab && window.__setTpTab('composition')"
              >
                {isKo ? "01 토큰 구성과 진단" : "01 Composition & Findings"}
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                role="tab"
                class="tp-ed-tab"
                data-tp-tab="lineage"
                aria-selected="false"
                onclick="window.__setTpTab && window.__setTpTab('lineage')"
              >
                {isKo ? "02 토큰 흐름" : "02 Token Flow"}
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                role="tab"
                class="tp-ed-tab"
                data-tp-tab="turns"
                aria-selected="false"
                onclick="window.__setTpTab && window.__setTpTab('turns')"
              >
                {isKo ? "03 턴별 내역과 프롬프트" : "03 Turns & Prompts"}
              </button>
            </div>
          </header>

          <div class="tp-ed-notice">
            <strong>SYNTHETIC REPORT EXAMPLE</strong>
            <span>
              Sessions: 1 &middot; Turns: 3 &middot; Calls: 7 &middot; Total Input: 73,000 tok &middot; Cached: 47,700 (65.3%) &middot; Output: 1,580 tok
            </span>
          </div>

